WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.981
Before adding devices, check your capacity. Your subscription
sets the device limit; operating funds are managed separately.

2
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:13.498
Open Device capacity and check how many devices your
organization can manage.

3
00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:20.149
This demonstration uses a test plan. Review the device allowance
and price shown in your own console.

4
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:26.938
Check the amount and recipient before approving prepayment. This
is separate from device operating funds.

5
00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:33.567
Apply the payment when it is due. Check the wallet request
before approving; a network fee may still apply.

6
00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:39.397
Check the updated device allowance. Adding operating funds later
will not change this limit.

7
00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:45.962
Capacity is active in this example. Next, add the operating
funds your devices will use.
